{
  "title": "万里数据库领导前往ITSU访谈交流 共谋信息技术服务创新发展",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>30</span><font>2024.08</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>万里数据库领导前往ITSU访谈交流 共谋信息技术服务创新发展</h2> <b>2024.08.30</b> <p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">近日，万里数据库总经理助理胡晓峰及销售总监田耕一行前往中国服务贸易协会信息技术服务委员会（简称“ITSU”），与ITSU主任委员单位贤牛（北京）科技有限公司副总经理刘剑、ITSU副秘书长刘阳等进行了深入而富有成效的座谈交流。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">贤牛（北京）科技有限公司销售总监孙纪伟、客户经理刘洋共同参加座谈。此次交流，不仅加深了双方对彼此业务领域的理解，更为未来双方在信息技术领域展开深度合作奠定了坚实基础。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"https://pics1.baidu.com/feed/79f0f736afc379314b979796ec843a4b42a9115b@f_auto?token=a7f01c03e6ce0581f1387b9bde3d7ebb&f=jpeg\"/></p><p><br/><span class=\"icon\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 2px 3px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: text-bottom; background-image: ; background-position-x: ; background-position-y: ; background-size: cover; background-repeat: ; background-attachment: ; background-origin: ; background-clip: ; background-color: ; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important; display: inline-block; height: 0.16rem; width: 0.16rem; top: 0.18rem;\"></span></p><p class=\"contentText contentCaption\" style=\"padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; letter-spacing: 0.2px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-top: 0.095rem !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span class=\"bjh-image-caption center\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 0.13rem; line-height: 0.18rem; display: block; color: rgb(132, 134, 145); text-align: center; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">访谈合影</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">座谈伊始，ITSU副秘书长刘阳首先代表ITSU对万里数据库高层领导的到访表示热烈欢迎，并详细介绍了ITSU的</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">成立背景、当前发展成就及未来工作规划</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">她指出，ITSU旨在为会员提供高价值服务，促进供需对接与产教融合，推动服务贸易增长及中国IT服务国际化，通过整合行业资源推动信息技术服务行业的创新发展，提升行业整体竞争力。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">刘阳副秘书长特别提到10月将在上海举办的“加速企业数字化转型 推动新型工业化发展”高峰论坛，以及由中石化共享服务公司牵头的《共享模式下的信息技术运维服务管理规范》团体标准编制工作等重点项目，展现了ITSU在推动行业标准化、促进数字化转型方面的积极作为。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">随后，万里数据库总经理助理胡晓峰全面介绍了公司发展历程、技术实力及市场布局。胡晓峰表示，万里数据库作为国家高新技术企业及国家级“专精特新”小巨人企业，专注于国产自主创新数据库产品的研发，拥有超过20年技术积累，并于</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">去年首批通过了国家安全可靠测评，是国家层面认可的“信创数据库”产品</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">，安全数据库GreatDB产品在功能、性能、稳定性及易用性等方面均处于行业领先地位，广泛应用于</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">金融、运营商、能源、政企、交通</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">等多个行业的关键业务系统中，赢得了市场高度认可。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">此外，公司主导创建了GreatSQL开源数据库社区，已成为国内MySQL技术路线的重要开源分支。社区的愿景是成为“中国广受欢迎的开源数据库社区”，于2022年获得</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">中国信通院可信开源社区与可信开源项目双认证</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">，2023年</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">正式捐赠给开放原子开源基金会，成为其旗下孵化项目</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">，拥有高度的社区活跃度与金融、通信、IT、互联网等多行业落地应用实践。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style